    "heading": "Protect",
    "lineStart": 1894,
    "lineEnd": 1898
  },
  "section": "23.5",
  "rulesText": "You step in to face a consequence that one of your teammates would otherwise face. **You suffer it instead of them. You may roll to resist it as normal.** Describe how you intervene.\n\n> This is how you do the \"I'll dive in front of the bullet\" You cover for a teammate, suffering any harm or consequences that still linger after you've rolled to resist. It hurts, cost stress, and may leave you in a bad spot. But hey, you're a hero."
}
